{
  "_about": [
    "Every file in toolkit/job-template, read by scripts/upgrade-job.sh and checked by scripts/check-repo.sh.",
    "kind 'template': the studio's code. An upgrade takes the new copy, three-way merged if the job edited it.",
    "kind 'mixed': template code that jobs are expected to edit (card layout, the older motion engine). Always three-way merged, never overwritten.",
    "kind 'job': the job's own file, started from this example. An upgrade adds it only when the job has none, and never changes it.",
    "needs: { file: [names] } means this file only works with that file from the same template. An upgrade of this file brings that file too,",
    "and upgrade-job.sh --check looks in the job's copy of that file for a definition of each name (the names older copies lacked, or every name imported)."
  ],
  "files": {
